  dialogue:
  - speaker: The Arcane Prisoner
    text: Free! Finally, I am free at last!
  - speaker: The Arcane Prisoner
    text: And you're the one who freed me. How unfortunate.
  - speaker: The Arcane Prisoner
    text: Normally, I would reward your courage, but no one can know of my escape.
  - speaker: The Arcane Prisoner
    text: After all, the Emperor seeks to silence all who know of the prophecy.
  - speaker: The Arcane Prisoner
    text: I'm sorry, little one, but I'll have to make you disappear.
  - speaker: 
    text: An elephant does not require the pity of an ant.
